==Icelandic==

===Verb===
'''skipta''' ([[skipti]], [[skipt]])

# (with dative) to [[divide]], to [[partition]], to [[cleave]]
#: ''Ég skal '''skipta''' appelsínunni í tvo hluta.''
#:: I'll '''divide''' the orange into two parts.
# (with dative) to [[distribute]], to [[divide]] amongst
# (with dative) to [[change]]
#: ''Af hverju '''skiptir''' himininn litum?''
#:: Why does the sky '''change''' colours?
# (with dative) to [[change]], [[exchange]], to [[swap]]
#: ''Ég '''[[skipta fyrir|skipti]]''' gamla bílnum mínum [[skipta fyrir|fyrir]] nýjan.''
#:: I '''exchanged''' my old car for a new one.
#: ''Ég '''skipti''' [[króna|krónunum]] mínum í dollara.''
#:: I '''converted''' my krónur to dollars.
# (with dative)
# {{lb|is|impersonal|with dative}} to [[matter]]
#: ''Það [[skipta máli|'''skiptir''' engu máli]].''
#:: It doesn't '''matter'''.
#: ''Það [[skipta máli|'''skiptir''' ekki máli]].''
#:: It doesn't '''matter'''.
#: ''Það [[skipta máli|'''skiptir''' máli]].''
#:: It '''matters'''.
#: ''Þeir riðu svo tugum '''skiptir'''.''
#:: They rode by the dozens.
#: ''Ég hef ekki séð hana svo mánuðum '''skiptir'''.''
#:: I haven't seen her for months on end.

====Usage notes====
* In the sense {{m|is|skipta máli||to matter}}, when emphasis is added to the word {{m|is|skipta}} it is the equivalent of adding the [[auxiliary verb]] {{m|en|do}} with emphasis:
*: ''Þetta 'skiptir' máli!''
*:: This 'does' matter!

